<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bendigo finds 300,000 oz gold resource.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bendigo finds 300,000 oz gold resource.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Victorian gold miner Bendigo Mining NL said on Monday it had discovered and defined resources totalling 300,000 ounces of gold on its tenements at Bendigo.</p>
</text>
